WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.435
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:07.705 --> 00:09.025
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

3
01:49.505 --> 01:51.865
YUANZHOU DIGITAL COLLECTIBLES CLOSES SERIES C FUNDING

4
02:04.785 --> 02:08.825
YUANZHOU DIGITAL COLLECTIBLES HAS COMPLETED HUNDREDS OF MILLIONS OF YUAN

5
02:08.905 --> 02:11.545
IN SERIES C ROUND LED BY MORSE CHINA

6
02:11.625 --> 02:12.785
Miss Xu, come. Join us for a photo.

7
02:14.185 --> 02:16.585
-Come on. -Go on.

8
02:30.385 --> 02:31.345
Alright.

9
02:31.425 --> 02:32.985
-Okay, thanks. -You guys go ahead.

10
02:33.065 --> 02:34.385
Come, Li.

11
02:34.465 --> 02:35.985
-Come on. -That's correct.

12
02:37.545 --> 02:38.705
So beautiful.

13
02:40.065 --> 02:40.945
Congratulations.

14
02:41.825 --> 02:43.145
-Who's that? -Xu Chi.

15
02:43.225 --> 02:45.105
-That's her? -So young.

16
02:45.185 --> 02:46.185
Yet she's so capable.

17
02:57.625 --> 02:58.585
What's wrong?

18
02:59.945 --> 03:01.665
Don't want to see him looking all smug?

19
03:04.185 --> 03:05.025
Stay here with me for a bit.

20
03:06.465 --> 03:07.505
Okay.

21
03:20.825 --> 03:22.185
What are you thinking about?

22
03:23.625 --> 03:26.065
I'm thinking about how much longer we have to wait.

23
03:28.345 --> 03:29.545
Before the fish takes the bait?

24
03:33.105 --> 03:34.705
Then we'll need some patience.

25
03:36.705 --> 03:37.625
Yeah.

26
03:39.545 --> 03:40.825
They just signed the formal contract.

27
03:40.905 --> 03:42.825
They need to operate for a while.

28
03:43.505 --> 03:44.865
Once the numbers start looking bad,

29
03:44.945 --> 03:47.425
that's when we get our chance to push him into the pit.

30
03:48.025 --> 03:50.265
You think it's taking too long and you're getting restless?

31
03:51.185 --> 03:53.105
Aren't there still the Tianhe and Morse projects?

32
03:55.385 --> 03:56.785
It's not that I'm getting restless.

33
03:59.065 --> 04:02.265
I'm afraid I won't have time to enjoy being in love with you.

34
04:05.025 --> 04:07.745
Actually, I don't have that much time for dating.

35
04:08.345 --> 04:09.625
I've got my own stuff to deal with.

36
04:10.465 --> 04:12.345
Maxmise's investigation results still aren't out.

37
04:12.425 --> 04:15.425
The key issue is stuck on Yang Rui.

38
04:15.505 --> 04:18.184
He refuses to admit that I have nothing to do with this.

39
04:18.705 --> 04:21.624
He insists that I wrote that report with him

40
04:22.145 --> 04:23.585
under Ma Ke's orders.

41
04:26.105 --> 04:27.945
-Let me go talk to Mr. Pi. -No.

42
04:28.025 --> 04:29.425
I still want to handle it myself.

43
04:31.785 --> 04:33.585
I don't want to sit around waiting anymore.

44
04:34.105 --> 04:35.145
I want to go on the offensive.

45
04:35.225 --> 04:36.905
The consulting world is small.

46
04:36.985 --> 04:39.065
Even if Mr. Pi does you a favor this time,

47
04:39.145 --> 04:42.345
I'll always carry a stain I can never wash off.

48
04:42.425 --> 04:46.105
Clearing your name yourself is the only way that feels satisfying.

49
04:48.425 --> 04:49.465
You're right.

50
04:50.745 --> 04:52.025
What a stubborn little lion.

51
04:52.745 --> 04:53.825
Whatever you say.

52
04:57.945 --> 04:59.025
Then I'll go take a look.

53
05:03.625 --> 05:04.625
Look over there.

54
05:07.265 --> 05:11.225
A GENTLE BREEZE COMES

55
05:19.185 --> 05:24.985
THE SENTIMENTS LINGER

56
05:25.705 --> 05:26.745
Did you do this?

57
05:30.065 --> 05:30.985
No.

58
05:31.505 --> 05:33.185
I… I just saw it and…

59
05:33.785 --> 05:36.585
And you decided to pass the magic along?

60
05:42.105 --> 05:43.305
Such a coincidence?

61
05:45.145 --> 05:45.985
Yes, really.

62
06:34.665 --> 06:35.705
Thank you.

63
06:38.505 --> 06:39.945
I really like…

64
06:42.465 --> 06:45.625
your little "piggyback" gift.

65
06:55.865 --> 06:59.145
I've always felt like a passerby in this city.

66
06:59.785 --> 07:02.025
My biggest dream was just

67
07:02.545 --> 07:04.785
an old apartment with 40 years of history.

68
07:06.785 --> 07:07.785
I never thought

69
07:09.425 --> 07:12.825
a piece of that brilliance could actually belong to me.

70
07:18.465 --> 07:19.305
And me.

71
07:21.145 --> 07:22.585
I belong to you too.

72
08:11.825 --> 08:12.945
2024 BOLO CULTURE ANNUAL FILM &amp; TV ADAPTATION IP SLATE

73
08:13.025 --> 08:14.385
NO ONE APPLAUDS

74
08:24.985 --> 08:26.545
You saw all that?

75
08:28.185 --> 08:29.065
Saw what?

76
08:30.905 --> 08:32.025
Drop the act.

77
08:32.105 --> 08:34.185
I saw you replying in the group chat.

78
08:35.705 --> 08:36.945
Quick question.

79
08:37.024 --> 08:38.825
How does it feel seeing your former subordinate

80
08:38.904 --> 08:39.784
doing so well now?

81
08:40.425 --> 08:42.305
However you're feeling right now, that's how I'm feeling.

82
08:43.825 --> 08:45.065
Look at her.

83
08:45.145 --> 08:45.985
She's suspended pending investigation,

84
08:46.065 --> 08:47.905
and she still pulled off a hundred-million-yuan deal.

85
08:47.985 --> 08:48.825
You're really not jealous?

86
08:50.985 --> 08:52.665
No. I'm just envious.

87
08:54.225 --> 08:56.505
People go through ups and downs.

88
08:56.585 --> 08:59.425
No need to get all worked up over winning or losing one round.

89
09:00.545 --> 09:03.225
So whether it's Xu Chi landing a huge investment banking deal

90
09:03.305 --> 09:06.825
or you making the Bolo Culture project such a success for me,

91
09:06.905 --> 09:09.225
I just feel envious and happy for you.

92
09:10.385 --> 09:11.545
But what if you're really just

93
09:11.625 --> 09:13.585
a runner-up for life and never get a medal?

94
09:16.065 --> 09:18.985
You've always been a wallflower at the consulting association's mixers,

95
09:19.065 --> 09:20.185
but you still sign up every year.

96
09:24.905 --> 09:26.065
I really don't like you.

97
09:26.585 --> 09:28.625
But I really do like you.

98
09:29.145 --> 09:30.985
Even though you know you can never win an argument with me,

99
09:31.065 --> 09:32.265
you keep coming back for more.

100
09:33.865 --> 09:35.105
I won't hold it against you.

101
09:36.025 --> 09:37.505
You're my team member, you know.

102
09:51.945 --> 09:53.105
Mr. Shen?

103
09:53.745 --> 09:55.105
What are you doing here?

104
09:55.185 --> 09:56.825
I take a nap here every day at noon.

105
09:56.905 --> 09:59.225
-Are you okay? Come on. -I… I think I threw

106
09:59.305 --> 10:01.145
-my back out. -Easy now.

107
10:01.225 --> 10:02.305
Come on.

108
10:03.345 --> 10:04.385
Easy.

109
10:05.425 --> 10:07.065
-How did my back suddenly just… -Careful.

110
10:07.585 --> 10:10.225
This way. Left. Come sit. Sit.

111
10:10.745 --> 10:11.665
I'll go slow.

112
10:12.225 --> 10:14.225
-Sit down slowly. -I'm going slow.

113
10:18.425 --> 10:19.745
Your back… Is your neck okay?

114
10:19.825 --> 10:21.945
-My neck's fine. It's my back. -Your back.

115
10:23.785 --> 10:24.625
Here, hold this.

116
10:25.825 --> 10:27.185
-Right here? -Yeah.

117
10:33.985 --> 10:34.865
My back hurts,

118
10:34.945 --> 10:36.665
but how come I feel so much better when you press my knee?

119
10:38.305 --> 10:39.385
It's called the Weizhong acupoint.

120
10:39.465 --> 10:40.945
I used to get back pain all the time when I was pregnant.

121
10:41.025 --> 10:42.225
Xu Chi taught me.

122
10:44.825 --> 10:46.745
-Take it easy. -Weizhong acupoint?

123
10:47.785 --> 10:51.105
Xu… Xu Chi?

124
10:54.385 --> 10:56.505
You're not bothered by Xu Chi anymore?

125
10:58.065 --> 10:59.145
Bothered by what?

126
10:59.905 --> 11:01.265
Hey, come on.

127
11:01.345 --> 11:04.185
I heard what you said to Cindy earlier.

128
11:04.705 --> 11:06.505
Xu Chi is doing better than you now.

129
11:07.225 --> 11:08.545
You really are okay with it?

130
11:11.545 --> 11:13.665
Mr. Shen, this has nothing to do with work.

131
11:13.745 --> 11:14.705
Can I not answer?

132
11:14.785 --> 11:16.905
Come on, don't play dumb with me.

133
11:17.505 --> 11:19.105
Nobody knows all the history between you and Xu Chi

134
11:19.185 --> 11:20.585
better than I do.

135
11:20.665 --> 11:23.585
Spill it. Where's your little drama at now?

136
11:27.785 --> 11:29.665
It'd be a lie to say I don't feel anything at all.

137
11:29.745 --> 11:31.145
True.

138
11:31.225 --> 11:32.705
Xu Chi and I used to have our issues.

139
11:33.305 --> 11:36.905
But when it came to my divorce, she really helped me out a lot.

140
11:36.985 --> 11:41.385
If I were still jealous of her, I'd be a real piece of work.

141
11:41.465 --> 11:45.305
So now I just envy her and wish her well.

142
11:45.385 --> 11:47.025
I'm even trying to help her.

143
11:47.545 --> 11:50.465
Because a girl as capable as she is

144
11:50.545 --> 11:54.385
shouldn't get dragged into some ridiculous commercial bribery case.

145
11:56.465 --> 11:58.025
So you two swapped roles now?

146
11:58.105 --> 12:00.785
You're the Sun Wukong now, pulling 72 tricks on me?

147
12:01.585 --> 12:02.425
Mr. Shen,

148
12:02.505 --> 12:05.185
if there's nothing else, I'll get going.

149
12:05.265 --> 12:07.225
-Sorry for interrupting your nap. -Wait…

150
12:09.385 --> 12:10.985
Take it slow. Slow down.

151
12:12.585 --> 12:14.865
Alright then. Let me treat you to a meal.

152
12:14.945 --> 12:17.345
Think of it as a thank-you for fixing my back.

153
12:18.105 --> 12:21.025
No need. I already ate.

154
12:24.705 --> 12:27.305
Ate what? That sandwich you picked up off the floor?

155
12:28.985 --> 12:30.025
I'm really not hungry.

156
12:32.545 --> 12:35.425
This is an order. Now come have lunch with me.

157
12:36.825 --> 12:38.625
Don't forget, I'm the client.

158
12:50.425 --> 12:52.345
The steak is amazing. Why aren't you eating?

159
12:52.425 --> 12:54.265
You need to eat more to put on weight.

160
12:56.705 --> 12:59.225
You ordered this. I don't eat red meat, and I don't want to gain weight.

161
12:59.305 --> 13:01.465
If you like it, just have more.

162
13:01.545 --> 13:03.665
Oh, please. You don't eat red meat?

163
13:03.745 --> 13:05.665
You had so many photos of eating steak.

164
13:05.745 --> 13:07.225
I've seen them all.

165
13:07.985 --> 13:10.145
You're thin as a rail. Stop dieting.

166
13:12.185 --> 13:14.065
Okay. Stop checking your Moments.

167
13:14.145 --> 13:15.625
You blocked me on Moments,

168
13:15.705 --> 13:17.305
but Cindy didn't.

169
13:17.385 --> 13:20.145
She posted a ton of unflattering photos of you.

170
13:20.225 --> 13:21.745
Some make you look really heavy and messy.

171
13:26.745 --> 13:27.665
There you go.

172
13:28.585 --> 13:30.185
Eat more so you can put on some weight.

173
13:30.265 --> 13:32.185
Putting on weight boosts your immune system.

174
13:32.265 --> 13:35.625
That way, when you and Cindy go at it, you'll be in a better mood.

175
13:41.825 --> 13:44.385
Sorry. Did I say something wrong again?

176
13:46.265 --> 13:47.945
But honestly,

177
13:48.785 --> 13:51.425
when you and Cindy fight, it's like Tom and Jerry.

178
13:52.025 --> 13:53.185
It's actually pretty funny.

179
13:53.265 --> 13:55.945
Whenever I'm tired from work, I get a kick out of watching you two.

180
13:57.545 --> 13:59.665
You really have a way with words.

181
13:59.745 --> 14:01.545
Believe me, next year this day will be your death anniversary.

182
14:04.785 --> 14:05.865
Okay.

183
14:06.385 --> 14:09.825
Then mark my words, next year this day will be our wedding anniversary.

184
14:14.105 --> 14:15.025
Think you can beat me?

185
14:22.105 --> 14:23.025
Where are you going?

186
14:31.825 --> 14:32.785
Lin Long.

187
14:33.705 --> 14:35.785
Be careful. Are you okay?

188
14:38.665 --> 14:40.545
Put your phones away! Stop filming!

189
14:40.625 --> 14:42.225
Never seen an old lady with bad legs before?

190
14:43.545 --> 14:45.225
-Are you okay? -Stay away from me.

191
14:46.625 --> 14:49.185
I was just joking. Why did you take it seriously?

192
14:49.265 --> 14:51.745
-I just don't have a filter-- -That's enough!

193
14:52.265 --> 14:54.185
Still, that doesn't give you the right to push people around.

194
14:54.705 --> 14:56.545
You think just because you're the client, you can pick on me like this?

195
14:56.625 --> 14:58.145
Let me tell you, I've had enough of this!

196
14:59.905 --> 15:01.825
Who's picking on you?

197
15:08.105 --> 15:10.065
Lin Long. Lin Long.

198
15:12.705 --> 15:13.825
I know you're furious.

199
15:14.665 --> 15:15.945
Come on, I'll give you a chance.

200
15:16.905 --> 15:17.945
Come at me.

201
15:23.025 --> 15:26.185
Take it out on me. Come on.

202
15:26.905 --> 15:28.065
What's your problem?

203
15:29.025 --> 15:31.585
You're the one with the problem. I'm trying to fix you.

204
15:32.745 --> 15:34.265
A shrink is expensive and useless.

205
15:34.345 --> 15:36.105
Nothing works better than throwing punches at me.

206
15:37.345 --> 15:40.585
From what I've seen, you've been living like a robot lately.

207
15:41.185 --> 15:43.505
It was like that outside the bathroom that day, and it's the same today.

208
15:44.145 --> 15:45.865
Okay. I'll give you a chance.

209
15:45.945 --> 15:47.825
Just take it out on me.

210
15:48.545 --> 15:49.385
Come on.

211
15:50.705 --> 15:52.225
-You mean it? -Yeah, hit me.

212
15:52.865 --> 15:56.425
Your client now wants you to throw a few heavy punches at him.

213
15:56.505 --> 15:57.505
Come on.

214
15:59.985 --> 16:01.025
Don't laugh. I actually learned this.

215
16:02.025 --> 16:03.305
Like anyone hasn't trained.

216
16:03.385 --> 16:04.345
Come on.

217
16:09.985 --> 16:11.825
Be water, my friend.

218
16:12.545 --> 16:13.625
‎Make your move.

219
16:15.345 --> 16:17.225
Hold on. Let me get my nunchucks.

220
16:18.825 --> 16:21.825
Forgot to bring them today. I'll just use air as nunchucks. Come on.

221
16:24.865 --> 16:25.905
What's wrong?

222
16:26.825 --> 16:27.745
Wait.

223
16:28.385 --> 16:31.065
Well… Bruce Lee's back doesn't seem to be working too well.

224
16:31.145 --> 16:33.865
-My back's acting up again. -Go over there.

225
16:34.505 --> 16:35.385
-Go. -Wait. Slow down.

226
16:36.545 --> 16:38.625
Oh my God. Easy. Look at you…

227
16:38.705 --> 16:40.905
Why are you trying to act tough?

228
16:41.425 --> 16:42.265
Oh man.

229
16:48.025 --> 16:49.625
Easy, easy.

230
16:51.905 --> 16:52.905
No laughing.

231
16:53.505 --> 16:54.945
Why can't I laugh?

232
16:57.825 --> 16:59.545
Fine, laugh all you want.

233
17:03.985 --> 17:05.184
Mr. Shen, do you have feelings for me?

234
17:08.985 --> 17:11.145
When I was pregnant, you took me to the hospital

235
17:11.224 --> 17:12.865
and got me that amulet.

236
17:12.944 --> 17:14.825
And now on this project, you're always looking out for me.

237
17:15.424 --> 17:17.464
You care about my health, my eating habits,

238
17:17.545 --> 17:19.905
and you let me hit you and yell at you. Is all of this just to make me happy?

239
17:21.385 --> 17:23.665
I… I don't. Don't be ridiculous.

240
17:26.785 --> 17:30.385
You love to tease me, and you're trying to get close to me.

241
17:30.465 --> 17:32.945
Is this your way of getting my attention?

242
17:33.025 --> 17:34.545
No. I…

243
17:35.785 --> 17:38.385
I… I… At most, it's just…

244
17:38.465 --> 17:39.745
It's just sympathy.

245
17:40.505 --> 17:43.185
I just want our project to go smoothly.

246
17:43.265 --> 17:44.265
Don't…

247
17:52.785 --> 17:53.785
Hello.

248
17:55.865 --> 17:57.545
Yes. Okay, okay.

249
17:58.065 --> 17:59.345
Alright, bye.

250
18:01.145 --> 18:02.345
Uh,

251
18:02.425 --> 18:05.025
the bank suddenly needs me for something. I should go.

252
18:05.545 --> 18:07.305
I… I won't be able to drive you home today.

253
18:07.385 --> 18:08.985
-See you around. -Okay.

254
18:26.305 --> 18:27.145
Why are you here?

255
18:27.225 --> 18:29.585
You've been off the grid. Your phone's been off too.

256
18:30.105 --> 18:32.945
I remembered you live nearby, and you said you like Benbang noodles.

257
18:33.025 --> 18:36.105
I searched all over a food app. Finally found the place.

258
18:36.185 --> 18:37.425
What?

259
18:37.505 --> 18:39.825
You escaped your misery, went to a new company to live it up,

260
18:39.905 --> 18:41.425
and now you're here to show off?

261
18:46.305 --> 18:48.945
I just found out you told the investigation team

262
18:49.025 --> 18:51.905
that the plan to make Celestial redo their microservices architecture

263
18:51.985 --> 18:55.025
was something we did together under Ma Ke's orders.

264
18:55.105 --> 18:56.225
Why did you set me up?

265
18:56.305 --> 18:59.385
You know I was against that plan. I tried to change it more than once.

266
19:01.865 --> 19:02.865
Trying to trap me?

267
19:03.985 --> 19:05.105
Dare you unlock it?

268
19:19.585 --> 19:20.505
Explain it.

269
19:20.585 --> 19:22.585
You broke up with me.

270
19:22.665 --> 19:24.665
You said we should part on good terms.

271
19:24.745 --> 19:27.225
So why did you lie to the investigation team

272
19:27.305 --> 19:28.585
and drag me into this mess?

273
19:30.625 --> 19:33.305
Yang Rui. What did I ever do to you?

274
19:34.585 --> 19:35.865
You did do me wrong.

275
19:35.945 --> 19:37.265
Did you ever really like me?

276
19:37.345 --> 19:38.625
Your heart always belonged to someone else.

277
19:38.705 --> 19:39.985
What did I do wrong?

278
19:40.065 --> 19:41.705
I just listened to Ma Ke.

279
19:41.785 --> 19:44.345
Maxmise has such a high turnover rate. What's wrong with clinging to my leader?

280
19:44.425 --> 19:47.425
I didn't take a single cent from this, but they don't believe me!

281
19:47.505 --> 19:49.385
They have his transfer records to me, so they're saying I took bribes.

282
19:49.465 --> 19:51.865
Then show them the chat logs and flight info.

283
19:51.945 --> 19:53.665
I did. It didn't work.

284
19:53.745 --> 19:57.265
But I fronted too much money for Ma Ke. There's no way to sort it all out.

285
19:57.345 --> 19:58.385
I asked Ma Ke to testify,

286
19:58.465 --> 20:01.345
but he threatened me and asked me to drag you into it.

287
20:01.945 --> 20:03.905
Because your boyfriend is a partner at Hezong.

288
20:04.505 --> 20:07.425
If he's willing to cover for you, we still have a way out.

289
20:08.585 --> 20:09.945
I know it's despicable,

290
20:10.465 --> 20:12.305
but it wasn't easy for me to get into Maxmise.

291
20:12.385 --> 20:13.665
I have a mortgage and a car loan to pay off.

292
20:13.745 --> 20:15.145
And I want to make partner someday.

293
20:17.745 --> 20:19.265
I don't want to lose this one chance.

294
20:19.945 --> 20:20.985
Yang Rui.

295
20:21.625 --> 20:23.385
Let's figure this out together, alright?

296
20:25.105 --> 20:26.345
It's no use.

297
20:26.425 --> 20:28.225
The company doesn't trust me anymore.

298
20:29.865 --> 20:31.465
Otherwise, they wouldn't have kept me suspended for this long.

299
20:34.865 --> 20:35.985
Can you help me, Xu Chi?

300
20:37.545 --> 20:39.225
Get your boyfriend to step in

301
20:39.825 --> 20:42.505
and let me stay at Maxmise. I'll do anything.

302
20:48.905 --> 20:51.505
But I fronted too much money for Ma Ke. There's no way to sort it all out.

303
20:51.585 --> 20:52.425
RECORDING

304
20:52.505 --> 20:55.105
I asked Ma Ke to testify, but he threatened me

305
20:55.185 --> 20:56.665
and asked me to drag you into it.

306
20:59.905 --> 21:02.745
This recording should prove I'm innocent, right?

307
21:02.825 --> 21:05.665
It's a good start. But it's not enough.

308
21:07.265 --> 21:08.905
The investigation team might think

309
21:08.985 --> 21:11.545
Yang Rui only said those things to clear your name.

310
21:13.505 --> 21:14.905
Fair point.

311
21:14.985 --> 21:17.185
I'll also need physical evidence.

312
21:17.785 --> 21:19.305
You've made a lot of progress.

313
21:19.385 --> 21:21.545
At least you're trying to save yourself now.

314
21:22.305 --> 21:24.025
With something this complicated,

315
21:24.105 --> 21:26.705
you can't rely on the company to figure it out on their own.

316
21:26.785 --> 21:28.625
Drag it out too long, and you're done for.

317
21:29.465 --> 21:30.305
Sha.

318
21:31.225 --> 21:33.065
You got Lin to pass along what Yang Rui told

319
21:33.145 --> 21:35.345
the investigation team to me, right?

320
21:37.025 --> 21:38.145
You figured it out.

321
21:39.225 --> 21:40.385
Why are you helping me?

322
21:40.905 --> 21:42.825
You don't blame me for dragging you into this?

323
21:42.905 --> 21:45.345
After all, it was because I wanted to transfer to digital finance that…

324
21:45.425 --> 21:47.145
Why does there have to be a reason?

325
21:47.665 --> 21:48.905
You're my subordinate.

326
21:49.785 --> 21:51.625
You got framed just like I did.

327
21:51.705 --> 21:53.745
Of course, I'd help you.

328
21:54.985 --> 21:55.825
Besides,

329
21:55.905 --> 21:58.825
if you can get out of this, it benefits me too.

330
21:59.745 --> 22:03.225
For one, Bu Tianna will stop camping outside my door.

331
22:03.305 --> 22:05.225
And Richard will owe me a favor.

332
22:06.705 --> 22:10.945
But more than that, I want you to know that in this company, in this industry,

333
22:11.025 --> 22:13.745
not every leader steps on their subordinates

334
22:13.825 --> 22:14.705
to get ahead like Ma Ke.

335
22:18.505 --> 22:19.545
Thank you, Sha.

336
22:20.785 --> 22:22.905
Alright. Go find the people at Celestial.

337
22:28.065 --> 22:29.145
Sha.

338
22:29.905 --> 22:31.345
I've actually been thinking.

339
22:33.905 --> 22:37.985
Has Ma Ke still not admitted he took money from Director Peng?

340
22:40.585 --> 22:41.505
No.

341
22:42.025 --> 22:44.985
He only admitted to taking the request

342
22:45.065 --> 22:48.025
and suggesting an outsourcing company in the proposal.

343
22:48.545 --> 22:49.625
He never confessed to taking bribes.

344
22:49.705 --> 22:51.385
But Peng insists

345
22:51.465 --> 22:53.505
he personally gave Ma Ke two million in cash.

346
22:53.585 --> 22:54.865
There's a time, a place, and witnesses.

347
22:54.945 --> 22:56.825
Two million in cash?

348
22:58.105 --> 22:59.665
So no transfer records?

349
23:03.385 --> 23:05.865
If Ma Ke had finished the Celestial project,

350
23:05.945 --> 23:07.745
he'd be promoted to associate partner, right?

351
23:08.545 --> 23:10.425
Would he really gamble his whole career away?

352
23:11.425 --> 23:14.465
Is it possible he really didn't take the money?

353
23:15.065 --> 23:18.105
The company did check his credit records. Everything was normal.

354
23:19.025 --> 23:20.945
Can you arrange for me to talk to him?

355
23:21.025 --> 23:22.865
If we can prove he didn't take the money, this whole thing is over.

356
23:24.145 --> 23:25.985
-You really want to do this? -Is there a problem?

357
23:27.105 --> 23:31.185
If you speak up for him now, you could get pulled in even deeper.

358
23:31.265 --> 23:34.145
You could've used this recording to clear your name.

359
23:34.225 --> 23:35.825
Why wade into this mess?

360
23:35.905 --> 23:38.265
Because the higher-ups have already decided that whether

361
23:38.345 --> 23:40.465
Ma Ke took the money or not, he is out.

362
23:42.185 --> 23:43.465
Even so,

363
23:43.985 --> 23:47.625
being fired for bribery and resigning over policy violations

364
23:47.705 --> 23:48.545
aren't the same thing.

365
23:50.185 --> 23:52.305
I do have a history with Ma Ke.

366
23:52.385 --> 23:54.585
I really have no reason to help him.

367
23:54.665 --> 23:58.065
But what you just said gave me an idea.

368
23:58.585 --> 23:59.585
I want to do something.

369
24:00.225 --> 24:02.705
To prove I can clear my name without relying on connections.

370
24:02.785 --> 24:07.625
To prove I'm not like Yang Rui, who drags others down with him.

371
24:22.705 --> 24:24.025
When are you going to see Ma Ke?

372
24:25.385 --> 24:27.425
How do you know Sha agreed?

373
24:27.505 --> 24:29.145
Sha's smart.

374
24:30.025 --> 24:31.665
She set up the meeting with Ma Ke.

375
24:32.705 --> 24:35.745
If nothing comes out of it, it doesn't hurt her personally.

376
24:35.825 --> 24:37.625
If something does,

377
24:37.705 --> 24:40.345
you and she become the heroes who saved Maxmise's reputation.

378
24:45.105 --> 24:47.385
Actually, I'm kind of scared now. What if…

379
24:47.465 --> 24:49.505
What if Ma Ke really did take the money,

380
24:49.585 --> 24:51.945
and I really do get pulled in deeper like Sha said?

381
24:53.945 --> 24:55.065
Hands off your head.

382
24:58.705 --> 25:00.945
Cross your arms in front of your chest.

383
25:02.745 --> 25:03.905
-Like this? -Yeah. A bit lower.

384
25:03.985 --> 25:05.025
Not that high.

385
25:05.745 --> 25:07.345
-Like this? -Yeah, that's good.

386
25:08.985 --> 25:11.705
Let's have dinner tonight. I want to introduce you to a friend.

387
25:12.705 --> 25:13.625
A friend?

388
25:14.145 --> 25:15.945
-A guy or a girl? -A girl.

389
25:16.025 --> 25:17.305
A girl?

390
25:19.425 --> 25:21.545
You know Jun'an, right? One of the top Red Circle Law Firms.

391
25:21.625 --> 25:23.345
There's this legendary lawyer, Bai Xiao.

392
25:23.865 --> 25:26.025
She has handled a lot of commercial bribery cases.

393
25:26.105 --> 25:28.145
If you have a lawyer with you when you meet Ma Ke,

394
25:28.225 --> 25:29.345
it should save you a lot of trouble.

395
25:36.945 --> 25:37.865
You did that on purpose.

396
25:39.545 --> 25:41.745
I just wanted to mess with you.

397
25:56.025 --> 25:59.065
Now this is messing with you.

398
26:11.465 --> 26:13.065
Cutie.

399
26:15.905 --> 26:17.265
Ye Xinzhi!

400
26:19.345 --> 26:21.065
Come on. Time to cool down.

401
26:21.145 --> 26:22.305
-Let's stretch. -You do it.

402
26:22.385 --> 26:23.625
-Come on, stretch. -Me?

403
26:23.705 --> 26:24.825
Me?

404
26:24.905 --> 26:26.225
No. I just finished.

405
26:26.305 --> 26:27.465
I just finished my set.

406
26:27.545 --> 26:29.065
So gross and mushy.

407
26:29.145 --> 26:31.425
I seriously can't stand you guys being so lovey-dovey.

408
26:31.505 --> 26:32.985
Spare me the details next time. Thanks.

409
26:33.505 --> 26:34.545
No, don't you…

410
26:34.625 --> 26:37.705
Don't you think he's so charming?

411
26:38.825 --> 26:40.065
Charming?

412
26:40.145 --> 26:40.985
I mean…

413
26:44.945 --> 26:46.065
Nice weather today, huh.

414
26:49.105 --> 26:50.945
Thanks a lot. It's raining today.

415
26:52.265 --> 26:55.745
I really can't talk to you women when you're in love.

416
26:56.265 --> 26:57.585
Aren't you in love?

417
26:59.825 --> 27:00.865
No, I'm not.

418
27:06.905 --> 27:08.425
You and Zhao Heng

419
27:08.505 --> 27:11.745
-are just colleagues who eat together. -Colleagues.

420
27:11.825 --> 27:13.225
Right, colleagues.

421
27:13.305 --> 27:15.105
What's wrong with colleagues eating together?

422
27:15.185 --> 27:16.345
Nothing.

423
27:16.425 --> 27:18.145
But going home together after dinner? That's something.

424
27:27.905 --> 27:28.825
Sha.

425
27:30.945 --> 27:32.025
Hey, Sha.

426
27:32.105 --> 27:34.145
I'm ready. I can head over anytime.

427
27:40.345 --> 27:41.665
I… I didn't mean it like that.

428
27:41.745 --> 27:43.025
Can you help me talk to him?

429
27:43.625 --> 27:46.025
Or a video call? Would a video call work?

430
27:53.065 --> 27:54.665
Alright, I got it.

431
27:56.825 --> 27:57.745
Okay. Thanks.

432
27:59.665 --> 28:00.705
What's wrong?

433
28:02.265 --> 28:03.425
Ma Ke refused to see me.

434
28:08.065 --> 28:10.705
-Why? -I don't know.

435
28:10.785 --> 28:15.065
Sha just said Ma Ke refused when he heard I was bringing a lawyer.

436
28:15.145 --> 28:16.025
He said I'm the last person

437
28:16.105 --> 28:17.545
in the whole company he wants to see right now.

438
28:21.345 --> 28:22.265
It's fine.

439
28:22.785 --> 28:24.665
Not seeing him doesn't cost me anything.

440
28:25.385 --> 28:27.545
I already met with Ms. Yu from Celestial this morning.

441
28:28.145 --> 28:31.985
She's pretty willing to help me. You think I should get her a gift?

442
28:32.065 --> 28:33.145
Is it appropriate?

443
28:34.745 --> 28:36.425
Let's build a model and analyze it.

444
28:37.625 --> 28:39.665
No need. I'm just giving a gift.

445
28:39.745 --> 28:41.825
Do we really need a consulting model for that?

446
28:41.905 --> 28:44.545
It's not about the gift. It's about why Ma Ke is dodging you.

447
28:45.265 --> 28:46.385
You changed the subject,

448
28:46.465 --> 28:49.425
but I can tell you're still not over it.

449
28:50.625 --> 28:51.705
EXPECTATION

450
28:51.785 --> 28:53.145
Three major problem models.

451
28:53.665 --> 28:56.065
Which one does Ma Ke's refusal to see you fall under?

452
28:56.145 --> 28:59.945
A gap between expectation and reality. So it's a restoration-type problem.

453
29:00.545 --> 29:02.025
But we really don't need to analyze it.

454
29:02.105 --> 29:06.185
Sure, I'm a little sore about it, but I'll sleep it off. Really.

455
29:06.265 --> 29:09.105
Will sleep really pull out that thorn in your side?

456
29:11.145 --> 29:13.505
Smart people always have one thing in common.

457
29:13.585 --> 29:14.865
They're not great at facing failure.

458
29:14.945 --> 29:17.505
When they hit a setback, they either shut down

459
29:17.585 --> 29:19.145
or have a total meltdown.

460
29:19.665 --> 29:21.265
So, my brilliant girlfriend,

461
29:21.345 --> 29:25.225
will you let me give you a consultant crash course today?

462
29:28.025 --> 29:29.065
Okay.

463
29:29.865 --> 29:34.265
Now we know what type of problem this is. So what do we do next?

464
29:34.345 --> 29:37.305
Analyze the root cause behind the phenomenon.

465
29:39.945 --> 29:42.865
There are about three directions.

466
29:43.625 --> 29:44.465
One,

467
29:44.545 --> 29:47.625
Ma Ke just hates me

468
29:47.705 --> 29:49.185
because of our past.

469
29:49.265 --> 29:53.145
Two, he's wary of lawyers, so he's resistant.

470
30:09.865 --> 30:10.745
So what's the conclusion?

471
30:12.785 --> 30:15.265
The investigation team is strict,

472
30:15.345 --> 30:18.705
so Ma Ke has deep hostility toward both Maxmise and me.

473
30:18.785 --> 30:20.305
If I want to achieve my original goal,

474
30:20.385 --> 30:22.625
I need to find a way to see him without a lawyer.

475
30:22.705 --> 30:23.785
But that's not hard.

476
30:23.865 --> 30:26.105
I've sent him packages before, so I have his home address.

477
30:26.625 --> 30:28.625
Wear the bracelet and bring pepper spray.

478
30:28.705 --> 30:31.105
Just like with Yang Rui. Better safe than sorry.

479
30:35.105 --> 30:38.985
Do you think it's shady that I secretly recorded with the bracelet?

480
30:39.905 --> 30:41.985
-No. -Then would you laugh at me?

481
30:42.505 --> 30:43.665
Because I was set up by my ex-boyfriend.

482
30:45.105 --> 30:46.305
Of course not.

483
30:46.385 --> 30:48.185
Without him, how would I look so good?

484
30:53.345 --> 30:54.345
You still want to help him, right?

485
30:57.585 --> 31:01.065
I always remember how he helped me when I first joined Maxmise.

486
31:02.185 --> 31:03.825
I actually don't think he's a bad guy.

487
31:04.465 --> 31:06.185
He was just forced into a corner.

488
31:09.585 --> 31:11.265
He probably didn't say anything serious.

489
31:11.785 --> 31:14.385
Otherwise, you wouldn't have had such an easy time

490
31:14.465 --> 31:15.625
during your leave.

491
31:16.465 --> 31:17.905
The investigation team would've been all over you.

492
31:23.625 --> 31:26.065
You're actually speaking up for your love rival?

493
31:26.145 --> 31:28.505
You think he's worthy of being my love rival?

494
31:30.825 --> 31:33.705
Honestly, you and Tianna belong together.

495
31:33.785 --> 31:36.265
-You're both so full of yourselves. -Whoa, hold on.

496
31:36.345 --> 31:39.625
I can't take that. That's way too rich for me.

497
31:39.705 --> 31:41.825
I'd rather stick to something plain and simple.

498
31:42.825 --> 31:44.465
Plain and simple?

499
31:44.985 --> 31:46.305
-Wait… Stop. -I'm "plain and simple"?

500
31:46.385 --> 31:49.145
My bad. My bad. Back to business.

501
31:49.225 --> 31:50.145
I give up.

502
31:51.305 --> 31:52.185
Good.

503
31:53.705 --> 31:55.785
By the way, I saw you preparing for class.

504
31:55.865 --> 31:58.585
Why did you suddenly decide to be a guest professor at a business school?

505
31:58.665 --> 32:00.665
The moment Morse's funding came in,

506
32:00.745 --> 32:02.825
Wen Ruosen started burning money like crazy on promotion.

507
32:03.345 --> 32:04.785
The agreement terms are so harsh.

508
32:04.865 --> 32:06.905
Even if we don't push from behind,

509
32:07.505 --> 32:09.585
he'll be driven forward by capital and greed.

510
32:09.665 --> 32:11.305
It's like playing Go.

511
32:11.385 --> 32:13.145
Once you secure your territory, you start building momentum.

512
32:14.105 --> 32:16.265
I can't just wait for the digital collectibles market to blow up on its own.

513
32:16.345 --> 32:18.945
Huanghe Business School is a well-known think tank.

514
32:19.025 --> 32:23.225
If I can use my lectures to let the people who get to shape policy

515
32:23.305 --> 32:26.065
know about systemic risks in digital collectibles,

516
32:26.585 --> 32:27.625
then Wen Ruosen's done for.

517
32:29.145 --> 32:32.185
I really love this scheming side of you.

518
32:35.825 --> 32:38.425
Consulting is always about open strategy.

519
32:38.505 --> 32:39.505
Not scheming.

520
32:40.185 --> 32:42.305
I don't care. I love it anyway.

521
33:14.705 --> 33:15.945
Mr. Shen.

522
33:16.745 --> 33:17.945
LACTATION ROOM

523
33:18.025 --> 33:19.025
You're still at work.

524
33:19.105 --> 33:20.905
What a coincidence. You're still at work too.

525
33:22.385 --> 33:24.665
Actually, I was just joking that day.

526
33:24.745 --> 33:28.465
You don't have to run scared every time you see me.

527
33:29.145 --> 33:32.105
Should I take the day off for the delivery meeting

528
33:32.185 --> 33:34.665
the day after tomorrow, so you won't feel so awkward?

529
33:37.945 --> 33:38.785
Not awkward.

530
33:39.425 --> 33:42.345
I just forgot a file. I came back to get it.

531
33:47.305 --> 33:48.865
This is your office?

532
33:49.665 --> 33:51.105
This is my new offi…

533
34:00.545 --> 34:04.185
Uh, it's my office during the day. At night they

534
34:05.105 --> 34:07.465
use it as a lactation room.

535
34:09.824 --> 34:11.744
No… This isn't right.

536
34:11.824 --> 34:15.025
I used to be the one laughing at you. How did the tables turn?

537
34:16.744 --> 34:19.625
Maybe before, you always saw me at my worst.

538
34:20.705 --> 34:23.705
But now I've finally pulled myself together.

539
34:25.145 --> 34:26.744
I… I… I wanted to ask you…

540
34:28.185 --> 34:30.264
You said all that to me that day.

541
34:31.665 --> 34:32.824
You don't have a crush on me, do you?

542
34:35.065 --> 34:36.385
Okay,

543
34:36.465 --> 34:38.824
stop. It's not gonna be anything good.

544
34:40.304 --> 34:45.185
I… I know myself pretty well. I know I'm…

545
34:49.744 --> 34:53.225
Who were you on the phone with? Not arguing with Cindy again, are you?

546
34:54.065 --> 34:54.905
It was Xu Chi.

547
34:54.985 --> 34:58.625
She wants to find a colleague to prove her innocence.

548
34:58.705 --> 35:01.385
But this guy moved after being suspended. No one can reach him.

549
35:03.425 --> 35:04.945
That's easy.

550
35:05.025 --> 35:07.465
Do you have his number? I can track him down in no time.

551
35:08.625 --> 35:10.345
Invading personal privacy is illegal.

552
35:14.105 --> 35:15.705
What are you talking about?

553
35:16.225 --> 35:18.465
I used to work in network security.

554
35:18.545 --> 35:22.105
If I want to, I have 10,000 legal ways to hunt him down.

555
35:23.705 --> 35:25.545
Thanks, but no thanks.

556
35:27.145 --> 35:28.745
Trust me.

557
35:28.825 --> 35:30.345
How old is he? Married?

558
35:30.865 --> 35:32.705
About mid-30s. His kid's eight.

559
35:32.785 --> 35:35.745
Moving is easy, but switching a kid's school is hard.

560
35:35.825 --> 35:37.265
As long as you know where his kid goes to school,

561
35:37.345 --> 35:38.905
just wait at the school gate.

562
35:38.985 --> 35:41.345
He's a local, middle-aged, unemployed guy.

563
35:41.425 --> 35:42.865
His wife would definitely make him pick up the kid.

564
35:44.825 --> 35:47.585
Don't rush me. I've been waiting two days.

565
35:48.105 --> 35:50.385
-Still haven't seen him. -But this afternoon at 5:30,

566
35:50.465 --> 35:53.425
Celestial and Maxmise are holding a joint investigation briefing.

567
35:53.505 --> 35:55.505
If you can't get through to Ma Ke before then,

568
35:55.585 --> 35:56.945
you might really be in trouble.

569
35:57.025 --> 35:58.065
I know.

570
35:59.545 --> 36:00.545
Talk to you later.

571
36:00.625 --> 36:06.505
EXPERIMENTAL PRIMARY SCHOOL EAST CAMPUS

572
36:08.705 --> 36:10.705
Ma Ke! Ma Ke!

573
36:13.425 --> 36:14.545
Sorry. I got the wrong person.

574
36:15.105 --> 36:16.585
-Sorry. -It's fine.

575
36:17.585 --> 36:19.745
Chi! Found Ma Ke. Get in!

576
36:19.825 --> 36:20.705
Found him?

577
36:31.185 --> 36:32.665
Ma Ke's kid is sick.

578
36:32.745 --> 36:34.905
-He's been at the hospital. -How did you find out?

579
36:35.505 --> 36:37.625
Du's team has a professional business investigation team.

580
36:38.985 --> 36:39.825
Great.

581
36:44.225 --> 36:45.465
But what if

582
36:45.545 --> 36:47.785
he's upset about his kid's situation and doesn't want to see me?

583
36:47.865 --> 36:50.905
The investigation briefing is in an hour and a half.

584
36:51.425 --> 36:53.025
My fate is about to be sealed.

585
36:54.265 --> 36:56.785
Our fate is always in our own hands.

586
36:57.585 --> 36:59.745
Back when I was framed, I had no one.

587
36:59.825 --> 37:02.425
But you're different. You have me.

588
37:11.865 --> 37:14.225
The kid's already been admitted. I'll talk to you later.

589
37:18.825 --> 37:19.785
Ma Ke!

590
37:20.905 --> 37:23.105
Don't you want to tell your kid his dad was framed?

591
37:26.825 --> 37:28.025
Let me just say three things.

592
37:29.385 --> 37:31.825
First, I'm willing to believe you didn't take Celestial's money.

593
37:32.585 --> 37:34.225
Second, I don't like you,

594
37:34.305 --> 37:36.105
but I really want to help you and Yang Rui.

595
37:36.185 --> 37:37.665
Because only by proving you didn't take bribes

596
37:37.745 --> 37:39.945
can I go back to Maxmise with my head held high.

597
37:40.025 --> 37:43.505
Third, I found a way to see the mid-term investigation report and found a problem.

598
37:43.585 --> 37:46.865
Peng from Celestial says you two met many times to discuss things.

599
37:46.945 --> 37:50.465
One of those times was last month on the 24th at 7:30 p.m. at Century Mall.

600
37:50.545 --> 37:51.905
But I checked your schedule.

601
37:51.985 --> 37:53.865
That night at 6:30, you were still near the airport.

602
37:54.665 --> 37:57.265
With evening rush hour, that's just impossible.

603
37:58.225 --> 38:00.065
Why would he lie about a detail like that?

604
38:02.785 --> 38:03.825
The investigation team believes

605
38:03.905 --> 38:06.705
that after Ma Ke's team received a two-million bribe

606
38:06.785 --> 38:08.065
from Director Peng,

607
38:08.145 --> 38:10.345
they revised the consulting plan

608
38:10.425 --> 38:12.825
to induce Celestial to purchase IP services

609
38:12.905 --> 38:14.145
from a company connected to Director Peng.

610
38:14.225 --> 38:15.905
Here's the evidence.

611
38:15.985 --> 38:19.505
One, in the chat records between Ma Ke and Peng Yuan,

612
38:19.585 --> 38:22.185
Peng Yuan hinted that changing the entire IT architecture

613
38:22.265 --> 38:23.585
would be better for Celestial's future.

614
38:23.665 --> 38:25.945
And after introducing a familiar vendor,

615
38:26.025 --> 38:28.145
he said he'd thank Ma Ke later.

616
38:28.225 --> 38:30.225
I HAVE TO THANK YOU IN PERSON FOR THIS LET'S MEET AT THE USUAL PLACE

617
38:30.305 --> 38:31.145
Two.

618
38:31.225 --> 38:32.065
FOOTAGE FROM THE CAFÉ ON THE 29TH

619
38:32.145 --> 38:34.145
The café surveillance footage shows

620
38:34.825 --> 38:38.785
that on the 29th, the two did meet at Century Mall.

621
38:38.865 --> 38:41.025
Director Peng gave Ma Ke a tennis bag.

622
38:44.705 --> 38:48.065
Three, Yang Rui admitted that afterward,

623
38:48.145 --> 38:52.345
Ma Ke did ask him to suggest changing

624
38:52.425 --> 38:54.825
Celestial's entire IT system architecture in the proposal.

625
38:55.745 --> 38:57.545
The evidence is rock solid.

626
38:57.625 --> 39:00.425
Our company's Inspection Department is all ex-economic crimes investigators.

627
39:00.505 --> 39:02.145
Xu Chi probably can't talk her way out of it.

628
39:07.065 --> 39:09.265
-You can't go in! -Here for the meeting!

629
39:23.025 --> 39:24.265
LEGAL DEPARTMENT

630
39:24.345 --> 39:26.505
Miss Xu, this involves you directly. You can't go in.

631
39:27.825 --> 39:28.825
Don't make me lose my temper.

632
39:29.545 --> 39:31.025
She really can't go in.

633
39:31.545 --> 39:34.065
I won't go in. Can I just edit the slides here?

634
39:34.585 --> 39:36.665
Zhao Heng. Do me a favor.

635
39:36.745 --> 39:39.225
-Hold this bag up. I'll record a video. -Okay.

636
39:39.305 --> 39:41.785
I’ve used wireless screen casting in this meeting room before.

637
39:41.865 --> 39:43.225
I should be able to do it outside of the door.

638
39:43.305 --> 39:45.545
All this evidence…

639
39:45.625 --> 39:46.985
-What's going on? -Exactly.

640
39:47.065 --> 39:48.505
-What's happening? -I don't know.

641
39:48.585 --> 39:49.785
-What's this? -What's going on?

642
39:49.865 --> 39:52.065
-No idea. -What's happening?

643
39:52.145 --> 39:52.905
I'M XU CHI. I'M RIGHT OUTSIDE THE DOOR

644
39:52.985 --> 39:54.265
Director Peng?

645
39:54.345 --> 39:55.705
I HAVE EVIDENCE CELESTIAL'S DIRECTOR PENG HAS BEEN DECEIVING THE INVESTIGATION TEAM

646
40:00.785 --> 40:03.425
CAMERA SHOWS MA KE MET DIRECTOR PENG

647
40:03.505 --> 40:07.425
THEN WALKED OFF WITH THE SO-CALLED TWO MILLION. BUT!

648
40:09.985 --> 40:11.825
HE DOESN'T KNOW TWO MILLION IN CASH WEIGHS AT LEAST 26 KILOGRAMS!

649
40:11.905 --> 40:13.625
WE PUT 25 KILOS OF DUMBBELLS IN THE SAME TENNIS BAG

650
40:13.705 --> 40:15.305
EVERYONE, TAKE A LOOK NO ONE COULD CARRY THAT OFF SO EASILY

651
40:18.745 --> 40:21.425
THE BAG'S DEFORMED. IT'S HARD TO CARRY!

652
40:34.505 --> 40:36.625
We're in a meeting. Can't let any involved parties in.

653
40:44.785 --> 40:45.785
I just need five minutes.

654
40:51.345 --> 40:54.105
Director Peng insists he and Ma Ke met in private many times

655
40:54.185 --> 40:55.625
to discuss things.

656
40:55.705 --> 40:58.505
One meeting was on the 18th at 4 p.m. at Binhe Brewpub.

657
40:58.585 --> 41:01.145
Another was on the 25th at 7 p.m. at Ohara Japanese Cuisine.

658
41:01.225 --> 41:03.825
But everyone, look at this. Ma Ke has severe gout.

659
41:03.905 --> 41:06.705
This is his prescription from a follow-up hospital visit on the 15th.

660
41:06.785 --> 41:10.545
Everyone knows beer and seafood are the worst things for gout.

661
41:10.625 --> 41:12.985
So how credible is Director Peng's story?

662
41:14.745 --> 41:16.385
That's just circumstantial.

663
41:16.465 --> 41:19.305
Maybe they were just talking and not drinking at all.

664
41:20.065 --> 41:21.305
I have other evidence.

665
41:21.385 --> 41:22.785
HOSPITAL OUTPATIENT MEDICAL RECORD

666
41:22.865 --> 41:24.305
This is Ma Ke's phone.

667
41:24.385 --> 41:27.065
Ma Ke and I contacted an engineer from Siwei Group

668
41:27.145 --> 41:28.505
to do a remote monitoring session.

669
41:29.225 --> 41:32.625
That's right. Siwei handles this phone's after-sales service in China.

670
41:32.705 --> 41:34.225
The engineer already verified it.

671
41:34.305 --> 41:38.785
The system and apps on this phone haven't been modified in any way.

672
41:38.865 --> 41:42.105
If anyone doubts it, feel free to bring in a third party

673
41:42.185 --> 41:44.065
for a more professional, accurate legal review.

674
41:44.665 --> 41:45.665
That's right.

675
41:45.745 --> 41:47.825
You may not know this, but this phone

676
41:47.905 --> 41:50.425
actually tracks the owner's location history.

677
41:51.065 --> 41:52.025
Take a look, everyone.

678
41:53.105 --> 41:56.225
On the 18th at 4 p.m., Ma Ke was near the airport.

679
41:56.305 --> 41:59.185
There's no way he could've gotten to Binhe Brewpub 15 kilometers away.

680
41:59.265 --> 42:01.145
Also, on the 25th,

681
42:01.225 --> 42:03.905
Ma Ke's location was very far from Ohara Japanese Cuisine.

682
42:03.985 --> 42:06.585
Could all of this just be Director Peng misremembering?

683
42:06.665 --> 42:08.145
It has that function?

684
42:08.225 --> 42:09.945
I need to check on my husband's phone.

685
42:10.025 --> 42:13.225
In short, I believe the mid-term investigation report

686
42:13.305 --> 42:15.425
relied too heavily on Director Peng's one-sided account.

687
42:15.505 --> 42:17.985
He's determined to drag our team down with him. Maybe he's gambling.

688
42:18.065 --> 42:20.105
He's betting that with two major companies cooperating,

689
42:20.185 --> 42:22.225
things can be swept under the rug.

690
42:22.305 --> 42:23.585
Mr. Zheng,

691
42:23.665 --> 42:25.705
please believe that Maxmise,

692
42:25.785 --> 42:28.385
as a top consulting firm, operates with professional integrity.

693
42:29.265 --> 42:32.305
Maybe the tennis bag just had a tennis racket in it?

694
42:43.785 --> 42:45.665
Everyone, please step outside for a moment.

695
42:45.745 --> 42:47.105
Sha Sha. Yu.

696
42:47.625 --> 42:48.825
Let's have a quick meeting.
